# Allowlist: only what the ci target reads reaches the build context. A new top-level file or
# directory that the build needs (benches/, build.rs, a config file) must be added here.
*
!.git
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!deny.toml
!charts/
!src/
!tests/
# The license texts, which tests/licenses.rs compares.
!LICENSE-MIT
!LICENSE-APACHE
!LICENSES/
# The rules reference, which the tests of src/detect.rs and src/redact.rs compare with the code,
# and the command-line reference, whose table of endpoint causes src/model/pure.rs compares.
!docs/reference/rules.md
!docs/reference/command-line.md
# The alerting rules, which promtool checks in the ci target and src/metrics.rs compares with the
# metrics, and the alerts reference, whose sections the same test compares with the rules.
!deploy/
!docs/reference/alerts.md
# The fuzz targets and the image ClusterFuzzLite builds them in (.clusterfuzzlite/Dockerfile
# uses this same context).
!fuzz/
!.clusterfuzzlite/
